        <elementInformation name="notes" show="1">Viri: Sigen Hybrid SP2, TP2 Series and SigenStor Energy User Manual str. 9-13 (pogl. 2.1-2.2.3); SigenStor Home Installation Guide - Three-phase System A1, V12 2026-08-17 (v ZIP) str. 1-8 (sistem, kabli), 12-16 (vgradnja BAT), 5.5.1 (COM); SigenStor Installation Guide - Three-phase Low Voltage System (COM tabela s senzorji) str. 3 (seznam senzorjev), 26 (pogl. 5.4); Sigen EV AC Charger Installation Guide, V05 2025-07-17 (v ZIP) str. 1-2 (zunanjost), 3-4 (MCB, kabli), 10-16 (priključki); C&amp;I Sigen Inverter &amp; Sigen Battery ESS User Manual (seznam senzorjev) str. 25; Eastron SDM630MCT 40mA User Manual V3.6 (kopija uradnega PDF na deyeinverter.com) str. 21-24 (specifikacije, mere, ožičenje 3P4W)</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="width" show="1">72</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="height" show="1">94.5</elementInformation>
        <elementInformation name="depth" show="1">65</elementInformation>
    </elementInformations>
